# This file exists so that docs/dev/news/ survives a release.
#
# `prepare` deletes every release note in this directory, and Git does not track
# empty directories, so without a file here the directory disappears entirely:
# `git ls-tree -r v4.11.0 -- docs/dev/news` is empty, as it is at v4.10.0 and
# v4.9.2. A contributor cloning at a release tag then has to recreate it before
# they can add a release note.
#
# `NewsFragments.IGNORED` skips this file, so it is never mistaken for a note.
